# Large model artifacts and private data
#
# Issue #133: the packaged default LSTM fall-detector sidecars (arch.json,
# metadata.yaml -- not the weights themselves) are tracked so the worker's
# env-less default fall model config has a manifest to validate against as
# soon as scripts/fetch-models.sh drops model.pt on disk. Git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is ignored, so a blanket
# `models/` ignore has to become the `models/*` + explicit re-ignore chain
# below to carve out just those two files.
models/*
!models/fall/
models/fall/*
!models/fall/lstm/
models/fall/lstm/*
!models/fall/lstm/arch.json
!models/fall/lstm/metadata.yaml
weights/
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.pte
*.tflite
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.h5
data/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a

